 "premise": "Schoolgirl Mikako Nagamine is recruited to pilot a giant robot in the UN Space Army's war against the alien Tarsians, leaving behind her friend Noboru Terao. They keep in touch by cell-phone text, but as her ship travels deeper into space her messages take years to reach him while she barely ages. In the manga's ending, an adult Noboru has joined the UN rescue mission sent for her ship, and Mikako believes they will meet again.",
 "life_message": "Love and longing endure across distance and time, even when war and duty separate people.",
